  <entry>
    <title>a53-jlink调试</title>
    <link href="/2026/07/16/a53-jlink%E8%B0%83%E8%AF%95/"/>
    <url>/2026/07/16/a53-jlink%E8%B0%83%E8%AF%95/</url>
    
    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>在win环境下实现jlink调试ARM Cortex-A53</p><h1 id="环境"><a href="#环境" class="headerlink" title="环境"></a>环境</h1><ol><li><p>jlink 软硬件环境</p><ul><li>硬件版本：V11 Base。注意pin1的状态（可通过内部跳线帽修改）</li><li>驱动版本：<a href="https://www.segger.com/downloads/jlink/JLink_Windows_V810_x86_64.exe">JLink_Windows_V810_x86_64.exe</a></li></ul></li><li><p>jlink script files</p><ul><li>配置CORESIGHT_SetCoreBaseAddr和CORESIGHT_SetCTICoreBaseAddr</li><li>当存在多核心时，各核心的地址不同（由硬件决定），当前仅实现单核的debug</li></ul> <figure class="highlight scss"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs scss">int <span class="hljs-built_in">ConfigTargetSettings</span>(void) &#123;<br>    <span class="hljs-built_in">JLINK_ExecCommand</span>(&quot;JLINK_CPU = CORTEX_A53;&quot;);<br>    <span class="hljs-built_in">JLINK_ExecCommand</span>(&quot;CORESIGHT_SetCoreBaseAddr = <span class="hljs-number">0</span>x80010000&quot;);<br>    <span class="hljs-built_in">JLINK_ExecCommand</span>(&quot;CORESIGHT_SetCTICoreBaseAddr = <span class="hljs-number">0</span>x80020000&quot;);<br>    return <span class="hljs-number">0</span>;<br>&#125;<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure></li><li><p>硬件调试环境</p><ul><li>通过JTAG连接目标板</li></ul></li></ol><h1 id="调试"><a href="#调试" class="headerlink" title="调试"></a>调试</h1><ol><li>启动JLinkGDBServer，启动时配置<ul><li>Target device: Cortex-A53</li><li>Target Interface: JTAG</li><li>Speed: 推荐先使用固定的低速率进行测试</li><li>Script file: 指定为上面的脚本，配置CoreSight相关的信息</li><li>GDB port: 可指定端口号</li></ul></li></ol><p><img src="/2026/07/16/a53-jlink%E8%B0%83%E8%AF%95/jlink_gdbserver_cfg.JPG" alt="jlink gdbserver"></p><figure class="highlight mipsasm"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs mipsasm">-select USB=<span class="hljs-number">0</span> -device Cortex-A53 -endian little -if <span class="hljs-keyword">JTAG </span>-speed auto -ir -LocalhostOnly -nologtofile -<span class="hljs-keyword">scriptfile </span><span class="hljs-string">&quot;A53.JLinkScript&quot;</span> -port <span class="hljs-number">2331</span> -<span class="hljs-keyword">SWOPort </span><span class="hljs-number">2332</span> -TelnetPort <span class="hljs-number">2333</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><ol start="2"><li>gdb调试<ul><li>启动gdb</li><li>连接至JLinkGDBServer对应的GDB port</li><li>load可执行文件</li></ul></li></ol><h1 id="图形化调试"><a href="#图形化调试" class="headerlink" title="图形化调试"></a>图形化调试</h1><ol><li>可以使用CLion实现图形化调试</li></ol><h1 id="多核调试"><a href="#多核调试" class="headerlink" title="多核调试"></a>多核调试</h1><ol><li>使用openocd替换JLinkGDBServer<ul><li>转换jlink驱动</li><li>建立openocd.cfg，可以参考raspi的相关调试配置</li></ul></li></ol>]]></content>
    
    
    
  </entry>
  
  
  
  <entry>
    <title>can调试记录</title>
    <link href="/2026/07/13/can%E8%B0%83%E8%AF%95%E8%AE%B0%E5%BD%95/"/>
    <url>/2026/07/13/can%E8%B0%83%E8%AF%95%E8%AE%B0%E5%BD%95/</url>
    
    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<h1 id="主要问题和解决思路"><a href="#主要问题和解决思路" class="headerlink" title="主要问题和解决思路"></a>主要问题和解决思路</h1><pre><code class="hljs">1. 模拟源can，互连收发测试正常2. soc can0外部自回环正常3. soc收不到模拟源的数据（确认soc会操作can总线进行发送）4. 模拟源收不到soc数据（确认模拟源会操作can总线进行发送）5. 进行soc can0、1互连测试，确认状态。0发1收状态下，收发正常5. 怀疑总线实际速率不对，怎么便于测试？7. 模拟源can实测速率一个bit 4.099us8. soc can实测速率一个bit 5.032us，与实际速率不匹配9. 翻阅手册，查得F_PRESC_SJW_SEG参数配置不对，分频系数和seg1,seg2,swj配置错误10. 修改F_PRESC_SJW_SEG配置，再测soc can一个bit 4.011us，基本匹配11. 与模拟源连接后，soc接收时非满帧丢失数据，驱动中的代码bug，没有放入指定buffer，数据放错</code></pre><figure class="highlight xl"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs xl"><span class="hljs-function"><span class="hljs-title">while</span>(0 != ((uint8_t)(READ32(&amp;can_ptr-&gt;</span>RCTRL_TCTRL_TCMD_CFG_STA) &gt;&gt; REG32_BYTE3) &amp; RSTAT))<br>&#123;<br>    <span class="hljs-function"><span class="hljs-title">memcpy</span>((uint32_t*)&amp;crtl_bit, (uint32_t*)&amp;can_ptr-&gt;</span>RX_BUF[<span class="hljs-number">0</span>], sizeof(crtl_bit));<br>    <span class="hljs-function"><span class="hljs-title">frame</span>-&gt;</span>dev_id = crtl_bit.ID;<br>    <span class="hljs-function"><span class="hljs-title">frame</span>-&gt;</span>format = crtl_bit.IDE;<br>    <span class="hljs-function"><span class="hljs-title">frame</span>-&gt;</span>can_fd = crtl_bit.FDF;<br>    len = crtl_bit.DLC;<br><br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span>(len != <span class="hljs-number">0</span>)<br>    &#123;<br>        <span class="hljs-comment">//此处len是每帧的树长度，并非每次帧数据都是8字节</span><br>        <span class="hljs-function"><span class="hljs-title">memcpy</span>((uint8_t*)&amp;frame-&gt;</span><span class="hljs-function"><span class="hljs-title">data_buf</span>[frame_cnt * len], (uint8_t*)&amp;can_ptr-&gt;</span>RX_BUF[<span class="hljs-number">2</span>], len);<br>        <span class="hljs-function"><span class="hljs-title">frame</span>-&gt;</span>data_len += len;<br>        frame_cnt++;<br>    &#125;<br><br>    SET_BITS(&amp;<span class="hljs-function"><span class="hljs-title">can_ptr</span>-&gt;</span>RCTRL_TCTRL_TCMD_CFG_STA, RREL <span class="hljs-string">&lt;&lt; REG32_BYTE3);//jump to next slot</span><br><span class="hljs-string">&#125;</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><pre><code class="hljs">12. soc发送时，模拟源接收，soc发送发错</code></pre><figure class="highlight xl"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs xl"><span class="hljs-function"><span class="hljs-title">if</span>(frame-&gt;</span>data_len % len)<br>&#123;<br>    <span class="hljs-function"><span class="hljs-title">if</span>(STB_FULL == ((uint8_t)(READ32(&amp;can_ptr-&gt;</span>RCTRL_TCTRL_TCMD_CFG_STA) &gt;&gt; REG32_BYTE2) &amp; TSSTAT))<br>    &#123;<br>        return -<span class="hljs-number">3</span>;<br>    &#125;<br><br>    <span class="hljs-function"><span class="hljs-title">len</span> = frame-&gt;</span>data_len % len;<br>    crtl_bit.DLC = len;<br><br>    <span class="hljs-function"><span class="hljs-title">memcpy</span>((uint32_t*)&amp;can_ptr-&gt;</span>TX_BUF[<span class="hljs-number">0</span>], (uint32_t*)&amp;crtl_bit, sizeof(crtl_bit));<br>    <span class="hljs-function"><span class="hljs-title">memcpy</span>((uint8_t*)&amp;can_ptr-&gt;</span>TX_BUF[<span class="hljs-number">2</span>], (<span class="hljs-function"><span class="hljs-title">uint8_t</span>*)&amp;frame-&gt;</span>data_buf[i * len], len);<br>    SET_BITS(&amp;<span class="hljs-function"><span class="hljs-title">can_ptr</span>-&gt;</span>RCTRL_TCTRL_TCMD_CFG_STA, TSNEXT <span class="hljs-string">&lt;&lt; REG32_BYTE2);</span><br><span class="hljs-string">&#125;</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h1 id="反思"><a href="#反思" class="headerlink" title="反思"></a>反思</h1><pre><code class="hljs">1. 应当及时向仿真同事确认速率问题后续：经过仿真确认，速率不对；修改驱动后再仿真，速率正确</code></pre><h1 id="其它问题"><a href="#其它问题" class="headerlink" title="其它问题"></a>其它问题</h1><pre><code class="hljs">1. soc can发数据，总线上没有波形，此时通过can寄存器可发现，出现bit错误的标志;后续硬件确认为器件损坏，修复后可发送数据，can总线有波形；</code></pre><p><img src="/2026/07/13/can%E8%B0%83%E8%AF%95%E8%AE%B0%E5%BD%95/can_bit_error.JPG" alt="can bit err"></p><pre><code class="hljs">2. soc和模拟源互联，soc发送时，由于速率不同，导致模拟源没有ack回应时。can寄存器有ack err</code></pre><p><img src="/2026/07/13/can%E8%B0%83%E8%AF%95%E8%AE%B0%E5%BD%95/can_ack_err.JPG" alt="can ack err"></p><h1 id="速率配置"><a href="#速率配置" class="headerlink" title="速率配置"></a>速率配置</h1><pre><code class="hljs">1. 一个Bit Time被分为多个TQ，TQ作为最小的控制单元，决定seg1和seg2的时间，Bit Time = t(seg1)+t(seg2)</code></pre><p><img src="/2026/07/13/can%E8%B0%83%E8%AF%95%E8%AE%B0%E5%BD%95/normal_bit_time.JPG" alt="bit time"><br>    2. t(seg1)等对应的TQ范围限制<br><img src="/2026/07/13/can%E8%B0%83%E8%AF%95%E8%AE%B0%E5%BD%95/tq%E9%99%90%E5%88%B6.JPG" alt="tq 限制"><br>    3. 注意t(seg1)&#x3D;(S_Seg_1+2)*TQ， <strong>S_Seg_1</strong> 是要写入寄存器中的值</p>]]></content>
    
    
    
  </entry>
  
  
  
  <entry>
    <title>利用github.io搭建blog</title>
    <link href="/2026/07/13/first-blog/"/>
    <url>/2026/07/13/first-blog/</url>
    
    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<h1 id="环境（windows版本）"><a href="#环境（windows版本）" class="headerlink" title="环境（windows版本）"></a>环境（windows版本）</h1><ol><li><p>git安装</p><ul><li>官方地址：<a href="https://git-scm.cn/install/windows">https://git-scm.cn/install/windows</a></li><li>安装后使用cmd或git bash输入<code>git -v</code>，输出版本，说明安装成功<br> <img src="/2026/07/13/first-blog/git_v.JPG" alt="git version"></li></ul></li><li><p>nodejs安装</p><ul><li>官方地址：<a href="https://nodejs.org/en/download/">https://nodejs.org/en/download/</a></li><li><code>node -v</code>，显示版本说明成功安装<br> <img src="/2026/07/13/first-blog/node_v.JPG" alt="node version"></li></ul></li><li><p>Hexo安装</p><ul><li><code>npm install hexo -g</code></li><li><code>hexo -v</code>，测试安装状态<br> <img src="/2026/07/13/first-blog/hexo_v.JPG" alt="Hexo version"></li></ul></li><li><p>在blog仓库文件夹下安装Hexo依赖</p><ul><li><code>npm install --save hexo-deployer-git</code></li></ul></li></ol><h1 id="git-ssh配置"><a href="#git-ssh配置" class="headerlink" title="git ssh配置"></a>git ssh配置</h1><ol><li><p>生成ssh key</p><ul><li><code>ssh-keygen -t rsa -C &quot;邮件地址&quot;</code> ，连续回车。生成的内容在id_rsa.pub中</li></ul></li><li><p>将ssh key加入githu中</p><ul><li>使用<code>ssh -T git@github.com</code>测试ssh key的状态<br> <img src="/2026/07/13/first-blog/ssh_test.JPG" alt="ssh test"></li></ul></li><li><p>配置git user.name user.email</p></li></ol><figure class="highlight stylus"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs stylus">$ git config <span class="hljs-attr">--global</span> user<span class="hljs-selector-class">.name</span> <span class="hljs-string">&quot;你的github用户名&quot;</span><br>$ git config <span class="hljs-attr">--global</span> user<span class="hljs-selector-class">.email</span> <span class="hljs-string">&quot;你的github注册邮箱&quot;</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h1 id="初始化blog仓库"><a href="#初始化blog仓库" class="headerlink" title="初始化blog仓库"></a>初始化blog仓库</h1><ol><li>初始化blog目录<ul><li>hexo init</li><li>可能会出现git clone失败问题</li><li>可能会出现npm install安装卡住问题，可替换npm源</li></ul></li><li>生成静态网页: <code>hexo g</code></li><li>预览网页: <code>hexo s</code></li><li>发布至github: <code>hexo d</code></li></ol><h1 id="编写blog"><a href="#编写blog" class="headerlink" title="编写blog"></a>编写blog</h1><ol><li>新建blog<ul><li><code>hexo new &#39;blog-name&#39;</code></li></ul></li></ol><h1 id="bug合集"><a href="#bug合集" class="headerlink" title="bug合集"></a>bug合集</h1><ol><li>hexo 安装后，无法正常显示图片，需要安装插件</li></ol><figure class="highlight awk"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs awk">npm install https:<span class="hljs-regexp">//gi</span>thub.com<span class="hljs-regexp">/CodeFalling/</span>hexo-asset-image -- save<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure>]]></content>
    
    
    
  </entry>
  
  
  
